# Playwright CLI output (may contain credentials)
.playwright-cli/

# Skills are tracked. The pattern here was `*.agents`, which matches the .agents
# DIRECTORY itself, not a file extension -- it silently untracked four of the
# eleven skills in .agents/skills, including all three gemini-* skills that
# AGENTS.md requires to be loaded before touching app/services/llm.py.
# A fresh clone therefore had 7 skills instead of 11 and the agent could not
# have followed a rule that referred to content it could not read.
.agents/
# corpus PDFs: convert to markdown with ingest/from_pdf.py, commit only the markdown
corpus/_source/

docs/DEPLOY.md